{
  "title": "Calcific Tendonitis",
  "url": "https://www.orthobullets.com/shoulder-and-elbow/3042/calcific-tendonitis",
  "subtitle": "Updated: Feb 14 2024",
  "sections": [
    {
      "text": "summary",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Calcific tendonitis is the calcification and tendon degeneration near the rotator cuff insertion, most commonly leading to shoulder pain with decreased range of motion.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Diagnosis can be made radiographically with orthogonal radiographs of the shoulder showing calcium deposits overlying the rotator cuff insertion.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Treatment is a course of NSAIDs, physical therapy, corticosteroid injections and ultrasound-guided needle lavage. Arthroscopic decompression of the calcium deposit is indicated for patients with progressive symptoms having failed conservative measures.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Epidemiology",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Demographics",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "typically affects patients **aged 30 to 60**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "5",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "**more common in women**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "5",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anatomic location",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "**supraspinatus** tendon is most often involved",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Risk factors",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "association with endocrine disorders",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "**diabetes**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "hypothyroidism",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Etiology",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "-1",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Pathophysiology",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "unknown etiology",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "**pathoanatomy**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "three stages of calcification",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "precalcific",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "fibrocartilaginous metaplasia of the tendon",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "2",
                          "children": []
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "clinically this stage is pain-free",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "2",
                          "children": []
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "calcific",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "2",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "subdivided into three phases",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "2",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "**formative phase**",
                              "table": null,
                              "images": [],
                              "importance": "5",
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "text": "characterized by cell-mediated calcific deposits",
                                  "table": null,
                                  "images": [],
                                  "importance": "1",
                                  "children": []
                                },
                                {
                                  "text": "+/- pain",
                                  "table": null,
                                  "images": [],
                                  "importance": "1",
                                  "children": []
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "text": "**resting phase**",
                              "table": null,
                              "images": [],
                              "importance": "5",
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "text": "lacks inflammation or vascular infiltration",
                                  "table": null,
                                  "images": [],
                                  "importance": "1",
                                  "children": []
                                },
                                {
                                  "text": "+/- pain",
                                  "table": null,
                                  "images": [],
                                  "importance": "1",
                                  "children": []
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "text": "**resorptive phase**",
                              "table": null,
                              "images": [],
                              "importance": "5",
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "text": "characterized by a phagocytic resorption and vascular infiltration",
                                  "table": null,
                                  "images": [],
                                  "importance": "1",
                                  "children": []
                                },
                                {
                                  "text": "clinically this phase is **most painful**",
                                  "table": null,
                                  "images": [],
                                  "importance": "5",
                                  "children": []
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "postcalcific",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "2",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "cellular biochemistry",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "**calcium hydroxyapatite** crystals are deposited",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "key molecular pathways involved",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "**osteopontin**",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "4",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "**cathepsin K**",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "4",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "**transglutaminase 2**",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "4",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Classification",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "",
          "table": [
            {
              "header": true,
              "cells": [
                {
                  "colspan": 3,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "**Gartner and Heyer Classification of Calcific Tendinitis**",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "header": false,
              "cells": [
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Type I",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Well circumscribed, dense calcification, formative",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [
                        {
                          "src": "https://upload.orthobullets.com/topic/3042/images/ombro_calc.jpg",
                          "caption": "Gartner and Heyer Classification"
                        },
                        {
                          "src": "https://upload.orthobullets.com/topic/3042/images/calcific%20tendinitis.jpg",
                          "caption": "AP shoulder"
                        }
                      ],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "header": false,
              "cells": [
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Type II",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Soft contour/dense or sharp/transparent",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [
                        {
                          "src": "https://upload.orthobullets.com/topic/3042/images/ombro_calc.jpg",
                          "caption": "Gartner and Heyer Classification"
                        },
                        {
                          "src": "https://upload.orthobullets.com/topic/3042/images/type%20ii.jpg",
                          "caption": ""
                        }
                      ],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "header": false,
              "cells": [
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Type III",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Translucent and cloudy appearance without clear circumscription, resorptive",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [
                        {
                          "src": "https://upload.orthobullets.com/topic/3042/images/ombro_calc.jpg",
                          "caption": "Gartner and Heyer Classification"
                        },
                        {
                          "src": "https://upload.orthobullets.com/topic/3042/images/type%20i.jpg",
                          "caption": ""
                        }
                      ],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "table": [
            {
              "header": true,
              "cells": [
                {
                  "colspan": 3,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "**Mole et al. Classification of Calcific Tendinitis**",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "header": false,
              "cells": [
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Type A",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Dense, homogeneous, sharp contours",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "header": false,
              "cells": [
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Type B",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Dense, segmented, sharp contours",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "header": false,
              "cells": [
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Type C",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Heterogeneous, soft contours",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "header": false,
              "cells": [
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Type D",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Dystrophic calcifications at the insertion of the rotator cuff tendon",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "",
                      "table": null,
